    "scenesThatPass": [
      "SHANAH: I rescheduled my last session, so I'll be able to make it tonight.\nALLYSON: You didn't have to do that. It's not that big of a deal.",
      "ALLYSON: My mom is a liar. She told me she invited my Grandmother tonight but she didn't.\nVICKY: How do you know?\nALLYSON: She never even called her.",
      "VICKY: What's your mom's deal? Why would she say that?\nALLYSON: She just tries to keep me away from her. Says she turns into a nutcase this time of year.\nVICKY: Your grandmother is Laurie Strode. If I were her I wouldn't celebrate either. I'd put up a Christmas tree instead. Just skip over all the sp…\nVICKY: Does she ever talk around it?",
      "ALLYSON: No. I think people made up the bit about them being related because it made them feel better. Like it couldn't happen to anyone.\nVICKY: To have a bunch of your friends get slaughtered by some random crazy person... how awful.",
      "VICKY: Yes, please.\nALLYSON: Go for it."
    ]
  },
